title: Raritan PX2/PX3: Hardware Failures
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/raritan
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Reads the PDU2-MIB hwFailureTable and reports {CRIT} for every entry whose
 hwFailureLastDeassertTimeStamp is 0. An empty table or a table containing
 only cleared entries is {OK}. The timestamp determines the check state;
 hwFailureAsserted is displayed as additional diagnostic information.

 Active entries show the affected component and a readable failure type.
 Details include the PDU and entry indices, asserted status, assertion and
 clearing timestamps in UTC, and the number of assertions. Cleared entries
 remain visible in the service details. Unknown failure types retain their
 numerical type code. One service aggregates entries from all reported PDUs.

discovery:
 One service called HW-Failure is discovered, including when the fetched
 hardware failure table is empty. A missing SNMP section is not treated
 as a successfully fetched empty table.
